			"notes": "Initial port to 1.19\n\nNow uses tags for spawning, so pigeon spawns can now be configured. (The wiki has more information.)\n\nChanges:\n- This release also reduces the pigeon spawn rate, so now you don't have to deal with an excessive amount of pigeons spawning in your world.\n- Pigeons will now follow any items with the `pigeon_love_foods` tag."
