			"notes": "## What's New?\n### Accessories\n\n_You can find the crafting recipes [here](https://github.com/ThePoultryMan/Pigeons/wiki/Pigeon#accessories)_.\n\n* Dress Shoes - Give your pigeon friends little shoes.\n* Tie - Make your pigeons presentable in all your meetings.\n* Moss Carpet - ~~It works as camouflage.~~ Make your pigeons feel like they won't ever be found.\n\n### Drops\n\n* Pigeons will drop 0-2 feathers when they're killed.\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n* If a pigeon is wearing an accessory, it will now drop it when it dies.\n* The smoke-like particles that come from mobs when you fail to tame them will also come from pigeons when taming.\n\n## Translations\n\n* ~~French Pigeons!~~ French by _Akarys_ (#6)\n\n## Other\n\n* Some back end changes relating to accessories. ~~Goodbye hard-coding~~\n\n## Version Split\n_This release contains both the 1.18.0-1 and 1.18.2-x versions._\n\nThere is now a 1.18.0-1 version, and a 1.18.2-x version. I will currently maintain both versions, and if I ever decide to discontinue the 1.18.0-1 version, I will make it clear.  \nThe versions were split because 1.18.2 contained significant changes to tags, which needed to be updated for this mod."
		},
