			"notes": "## Accessories\n**Thanks to _tristankechlo_ who fixed the saving issue. (#1)**\n\nYou can craft accessories for your pigeons now, feel free to read more about that in the description or the [wiki](https://github.com/ThePoultryMan/Pigeons/wiki/Pigeon#accessories)!\n\nThe two accessories implemented currently are the _Top Hat_ and the _Beanie._\n\n## Translations\n* German by _tristankechlo_ (#2)\n* Russian by _qualterz_ (#4)\n* Ukrainian by _qualterz_ (#5)"
